Third-party material

  Factory map geometry
    the-hideout/tarkov-dev-svg-maps
    https://github.com/the-hideout/tarkov-dev-svg-maps
    CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

  Item artwork (assets/items/*.webp)
    assets.tarkov.dev, from the community tarkov.dev project
    https://tarkov.dev

  Trader portraits (assets/traders/*.png)
    Escape From Tarkov wiki

  Item templates, names, descriptions, handbook prices
    SPT database dumps
    https://github.com/sp-tarkov/server

  Sound effects (assets/sfx/*.ogg) - all CC0 1.0
    Kenney, "Interface Sounds"
    https://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds
    rubberduck, "100 CC0 SFX #2"
    https://opengameart.org/content/100-cc0-sfx-2
    Thimras, "Metal footsteps on concrete"
    https://opengameart.org/content/metal-footsteps-on-concrete
    yd, "Short alarm"
    https://opengameart.org/content/short-alarm

    No Escape From Tarkov audio is included in this project.

